ready1_open_rewrite.raw_answer_text:
\textbf{Solution:} Solve the system of equations:
\[
\left\{
\begin{array}{l}
y=2x-1 \\
y=\frac{3}{4}x+\frac{3}{2}
\end{array}
\right.
\]
to get
\[
\left\{
\begin{array}{l}
x=2\\
y=3
\end{array}
\right.
\]
$\therefore$ The coordinates of point A are $\boxed{(2,3)}$.

